            "Whisk Greek yogurt, milk, eggs, honey, and vanilla until smooth.",
            "Add flour, baking powder, and salt. Whisk gently without over mixing.",
            "Fold in fresh blueberries, then cook three to four minutes per side on medium heat until golden and cooked through."
          ],
          "notes": "Exact quantities and nutritional values were not provided in the source text."
        },
        "sk": {
          "name": "Čučoriedkové lievance s gréckym jogurtom",
          "category_label": "Raňajky",
          "serving_unit_label": "porcia",
          "instructions": [
            "Vymiešajte grécky jogurt, mlieko, vajcia, med a vanilku dohladka.",
            "Pridajte múku, kypriaci prášok a soľ. Jemne premiešajte, aby ste cesto nepremiešali príliš.",
            "Zľahka vmiešajte čerstvé čučoriedky a opekajte na strednom ohni tri až štyri minúty z každej strany, kým nebudú lievance zlatisté a prepečené."
